            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[You can now show context-aware furigana from the selected AI model above kanji in Japanese source text.
Added GPT-6.1 Sol, GPT-6 Astra, Opus 5.5, and Fable 5.1 model presets.
Added Ultrafast for supported OpenAI models, offering faster answers at about three times the cost of Fast.
]]></description>
